{"book":"song-of-songs","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-29T23:34:20.795311997Z","verse":6,"ref":"song-of-songs 1:6","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":1,"translation":"Look not upon me, that I am dark, ⟨for⟩ the sun has scorched me. The sons of my mother were angry with me; they made me keeper ⟨of⟩ ⟨את⟩ the vineyards — my vineyard, which is mine, I have not kept.","tokens":[{"surface":"אל","gloss":"Do not"},{"surface":"תראוני","gloss":"look ⟨at⟩ ⟨me⟩"},{"surface":"שאני","gloss":"that I am"},{"surface":"שחרחרת","gloss":"dark"},{"surface":"ששזפתני","gloss":"has scorched me"},{"surface":"השמש","gloss":"the sun"},{"surface":"בני","gloss":"the sons of"},{"surface":"אמי","gloss":"my mother"},{"surface":"נחרו","gloss":"were angry"},{"surface":"בי","gloss":"with me"},{"surface":"שמני","gloss":"they made me"},{"surface":"נטרה","gloss":"keeper"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"the vineyards"},{"surface":"הכרמים","gloss":"the vineyards"},{"surface":"כרמי","gloss":"my vineyard"},{"surface":"שלי","gloss":"which is mine"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"נטרתי","gloss":"I have kept"}]}